{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1495841-damned-jack-supernal-being","id":1495841,"title":"Damned Jack (Supernal Being)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-29T12:35:52-07:00","id":1495841,"title":"Damned Jack (Supernal Being)","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Just in time for Halloween! Enjoy!</i><br /> ----------<br /> Oaths are tricky things. A clever Acanthus uses oaths as tools, deftly maneuvering through the tricky language and alternate interpretations. Scheme too much though, get too cocky, become trapped in your own game and Damned Jack takes an interest.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">He creeps into the edge of their Mage Sight, his eyes burning and his lantern lit by a coal from hell. Soot covers his tattered clothing, and his hat - frequently a top hat - sits askew on his head. Jack\u2019s appearance always features a dichotomy between two parties, representing the oaths he is trapped between. Frequently, this is the symbolism of heaven and hell - Jack often appears with tattered wings on his back and cloven hooves shod with silver shoes. More recently, these contrasts have taken a more modern approach and throughout the cold war he appeared wearing a bizarre mishmash of American and Soviet uniforms.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Jack is dangerous and he makes no attempt to hide it. He enjoys pushing Mages as far as he can, seeing how tangled and compromised they are willing to become before their panic. He has no love for the Exarchs or the Oracles - Jack serves himself first and foremost - he delights in tricking the Seers and the Pentacle into helping each other. If he has any allegiance in the Fallen World, it is to the Nameless Orders. This is less about helping others than it is one free spirit recognizing others cut from the same cloth, but Jack prefers to help those who refuse to drink the hierarchical kool-aid.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><u><b>Damned Jack</b></u> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Rank 2 Arcadian Moirea</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Power 6 Finesse 6 Resistance 2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vice: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cruel. Damned Jack has a mean streak a mile wide and never misses an opportunity to put the thumbscrews to someone. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Virtue:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Loyal. Jack will keep to the letter of his word, even if it puts him in harm's way. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ban:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cannot enter holy or unhallowed ground. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bane:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A coin made from silver melted down from crucifixes. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Arcana: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Death 1, Fate 2, Mind 2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mana: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">15 </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Corpus:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 7</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Willpower:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 8</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Initiative:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> +8</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Defence:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Speed:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 17</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Size:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 5</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Trial:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Swear an oath to a foe that benefits the other party. </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 10-29-2022, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T13:16:31-07:00","id":1495843,"title":"","content":"I like Jack! But does not his Ban a contradictory one?<br /> <br /> <i>'</i><b>Ban:</b><i>Cannot enter holy or unhallowed ground'</i><br /> <br /> Every ground that is not holy - is unhallowed, by definition...<br /> <br /> Maybe better would be <i>'Cannot enter Holy or Corrupted ground'</i>? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-29-2022, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T13:49:27-07:00","id":1495844,"title":"","content":"Eh, there's a point to be made there, but its so common in RPGs to frame unhallowed and unholy as &quot;evil religi